Description: Tesla companion: Bluetooth control, charge status and history
 SOCKS (State Of Charge, Keys and Stats) talks to a Tesla over Bluetooth LE,
 optionally through the Tesla Fleet API, shows charge status and range, sends
 everyday commands behind a confirmation gate, and keeps a local history of
 distance driven, charging sessions, efficiency and battery health.
 .
 This package bundles its Python dependencies (tesla-fleet-api, bleak,
 protobuf, aiohttp, cryptography and friends) under /usr/lib/socks-tesla
 because they are missing or too old in Debian. PySide6 comes from the distro.
 .
 Tesla is a trademark of Tesla, Inc. This project is not affiliated with it.
